@page "/"

<PageTitle>Burmese Poker — the table</PageTitle>

<h1>The table</h1>

<p class="lede">
    A round at a time, at a pace you can follow, against players the computer runs. Every hand is
    concealed until somebody lays all thirteen down — so you are shown your own and nobody
    else's, and anyone here only to watch is shown none at all.
</p>

@*
    ⚠️ The render mode is named here and nowhere else. The page around it is static SSR, which
    is the default and the thing that cannot be walked back cheaply (§3.11 C12). Your seat and
    the hand are inside this island, not a second one.
*@
<TableView @rendermode="InteractiveServer" />
